00:34:13.590 --> 00:34:16.810
Yeah, they forgot. I think that's where they're where he's asking for gems.

00:34:17.530 --> 00:34:19.190
Oh, OK. That makes sense.

00:34:19.290 --> 00:34:21.350
So then once you've fulfilled that, it just goes blank.

